902 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 670 0 R
/T (We are pleased to announce our acquisition of Fiesta Village MHC, a well located manufactured housing community in Mesa, Arizona. This investment represents our 17th acquisition in the Phoenix MSA, further strengthening our presence in one of the most resilient and supply constrained housing markets in the country. Mesa is nationally recognized as one of the strongest markets for manufactured housing, with a high concentration of manufactured homes and long standing acceptance of this housing type as a core component of the local housing ecosystem.)
/E (We are pleased to announce our acquisition of Fiesta Village MHC, a well located manufactured housing community in Mesa, Arizona. This investment represents our 17th acquisition in the Phoenix MSA, further strengthening our presence in one of the most resilient and supply constrained housing markets in the country. Mesa is nationally recognized as one of the strongest markets for manufactured housing, with a high concentration of manufactured homes and long standing acceptance of this housing type as a core component of the local housing ecosystem.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
903 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/P 670 0 R
/T (Fiesta Village is currently 91% occupied, with all public, sub metered utilities and an average space rent of $683, approximately 25% below market. The community includes 14 park owned homes that we plan to sell over time, creating an additional value creation lever while improving long term resident stability. The property features a strong amenity package including a playground, pool, clubhouse, BBQ area, and on site office, allowing us to focus on operational efficiencies, disciplined rent alignment, and continued improvements to the resident experience. Our business plan is designed to maximize cash flow while supporting sustained income growth and long term capital appreciation.)
/E (Fiesta Village is currently 91% occupied, with all public, sub metered utilities and an average space rent of $683, approximately 25% below market. The community includes 14 park owned homes that we plan to sell over time, creating an additional value creation lever while improving long term resident stability. The property features a strong amenity package including a playground, pool, clubhouse, BBQ area, and on site office, allowing us to focus on operational efficiencies, disciplined rent alignment, and continued improvements to the resident experience. Our business plan is designed to maximize cash flow while supporting sustained income growth and long term capital appreciation.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [4]
>>
